                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                                                                <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <p>Choose TWO letters, A-E.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-standalone-q ielts-multi-q" data-multi-qnums="25,26"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">25</strong> <strong class="ielts-q-badge">26</strong><span class="ielts-q-title">Which TWO topics do both students recommend should be included in the course?</span></div><div class="ielts-checkbox-group"><label class="ielts-checkbox-btn"><input type="checkbox" data-multi-qnums="25,26" data-limit="2" value="A"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>A</strong> sustainable fishing</span></label><label class="ielts-checkbox-btn"><input type="checkbox" data-multi-qnums="25,26" data-limit="2" value="B"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>B</strong> targeted nutrition</span></label><label class="ielts-checkbox-btn"><input type="checkbox" data-multi-qnums="25,26" data-limit="2" value="C"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>C</strong> global differences in consumption</span></label><label class="ielts-checkbox-btn"><input type="checkbox" data-multi-qnums="25,26" data-limit="2" value="D"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>D</strong> sustainable agriculture</span></label><label class="ielts-checkbox-btn"><input type="checkbox" data-multi-qnums="25,26" data-limit="2" value="E"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>E</strong> digital technology and food</span></label></div></div></div>
                                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                            <h2 class="ielts-reading-question-section-heading">
                                            Questions 27-30                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                                                                <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <div class="ielts-listening-section-content-wrapper"><p>Complete the flow-chart below.</p>
<p>Choose FOUR answers from the box and write the correct letter, A-F, next to Questions 27-30.</p>
<p>Student project: developing a new food product</p>
<p>Initial aim</p>
<p><span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">27</strong><select data-qnum="27" name="question_27" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 27 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This was challenging but enjoyable.">A. This was challenging but enjoyable.</option><option value="B. This led to some disagreement.">B. This led to some disagreement.</option><option value="C. This was easy to decide on.">C. This was easy to decide on.</option><option value="D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.">D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.</option><option value="E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.">E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.</option><option value="F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.">F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.</option></select></span></span></p>
<p>Literature review</p>
<p><span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">28</strong><select data-qnum="28" name="question_28" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 28 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This was challenging but enjoyable.">A. This was challenging but enjoyable.</option><option value="B. This led to some disagreement.">B. This led to some disagreement.</option><option value="C. This was easy to decide on.">C. This was easy to decide on.</option><option value="D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.">D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.</option><option value="E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.">E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.</option><option value="F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.">F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.</option></select></span></span></p>
<p>Product development</p>
<p><span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">29</strong><select data-qnum="29" name="question_29" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 29 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This was challenging but enjoyable.">A. This was challenging but enjoyable.</option><option value="B. This led to some disagreement.">B. This led to some disagreement.</option><option value="C. This was easy to decide on.">C. This was easy to decide on.</option><option value="D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.">D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.</option><option value="E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.">E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.</option><option value="F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.">F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.</option></select></span></span></p>
<p>Product production</p>
<p><span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">30</strong><select data-qnum="30" name="question_30" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 30 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This was challenging but enjoyable.">A. This was challenging but enjoyable.</option><option value="B. This led to some disagreement.">B. This led to some disagreement.</option><option value="C. This was easy to decide on.">C. This was easy to decide on.</option><option value="D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.">D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.</option><option value="E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.">E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.</option><option value="F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.">F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.</option></select></span></span></p>
</div>                                                <div class="options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--inline" data-dnd-group="3178426">
                                                    <div class="dnd-panel-instruction">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div>
                                                    <div class="dnd-cards-container">
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="A" data-text="A. This was challenging but enjoyable.">
                                                                <span class="dnd-label">A.</span>
                                                                <span class="dnd-text">This was challenging but enjoyable.</span>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="B" data-text="B. This led to some disagreement.">
                                                                <span class="dnd-label">B.</span>
                                                                <span class="dnd-text">This led to some disagreement.</span>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="C" data-text="C. This was easy to decide on.">
                                                                <span class="dnd-label">C.</span>
                                                                <span class="dnd-text">This was easy to decide on.</span>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="D" data-text="D. This was helped by the guidelines provided.">
                                                                <span class="dnd-label">D.</span>
                                                                <span class="dnd-text">This was helped by the guidelines provided.</span>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="E" data-text="E. This seemed like an unnecessary stage.">
                                                                <span class="dnd-label">E.</span>
                                                                <span class="dnd-text">This seemed like an unnecessary stage.</span>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="F" data-text="F. This involved selecting a new ingredient.">
